(7506574, 1196812, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image that does not meet the challenge<br/> <br/>I think I can see what your intentions were here Marcel but for me it does not work. I can see that there is some potential for implied lines but you are so close that those stalks visible dominate in a jumbled way that does not suggest the sort of uniformity that would reveal implied lines. I can also understand why you have placed the cob the way you have but it also dominates in a way that takes away from any implied lines. I think a further higher view would have revealed the lines of plantation that would have more readily lent themselves to an implied line illusion.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image that does not meet the challenge I think I can see what your intentions were here Marcel but for me it does not work. I can see that there is some potential for implied lines but you are so close that those stalks visible dominate in a jumbled way that does not suggest the sort of uniformity that would reveal implied lines. I can also understand why you have placed the cob the way you have but it also dominates in a way that takes away from any implied lines. I think a further higher view would have revealed the lines of plantation that would have more readily lent themselves to an implied line illusion.', '2017-03-27 14:08:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(7506576, 1197141, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that fully meets the challenge<br/> <br/>Congratulations Susan, a great score and placing for a great image, thoroughly deserved. The implied lines are abundant in the lines of the trees themselves and in their shadows so suitably contrasted against the white snowy ground. This is a very strong composition that makes full use of the implied lines perspective. It all works in a strong effective way, I wouldnt change a thing, well done.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that fully meets the challenge Congratulations Susan, a great score and placing for a great image, thoroughly deserved. The implied lines are abundant in the lines of the trees themselves and in their shadows so suitably contrasted against the white snowy ground. This is a very strong composition that makes full use of the implied lines perspective. It all works in a strong effective way, I wouldnt change a thing, well done.', '2017-03-27 14:13:37.000000', NULL, 0),
